      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e What does the \"other service\" actually mean?\nCan an apdu service be a other service?\nIf apdu service is an other service, it has state of selected or not selected?\n\n\nthere are 2 types of NFC HCE service - [CATEGORY_PAYMENT](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/nfc/cardemulation/CardEmulation#CATEGORY_PAYMENT) \u0026 [CATEGORY_OTHER](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/nfc/cardemulation/CardEmulation#CATEGORY_OTHER)\n\n\u003e I want to know what\u0027s the difference among 1) an APDU service which is not an other service, 2) that is an other service with selected state, 3) and that with unselected state.\n\nThis API is indicating that this HCE service is for category `OTHER` and was explicitly selected by the user. The APIs allow the user to disable services (via settings menu) with `OTHER` category that they don\u0027t like.",
      "parentUuid": "f853528b_9637c806",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 830,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 830,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "99e521a61de54095b5624fd9b7e663aca733b584",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
